{%- comment -%}
  Floating call button — ported from CallButton.jsx. Hidden at the top of the
  page, slides in past 220px of scroll (mts-theme.js toggles .is-visible).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if settings.phone != blank -%}
  <a class="callbtn" data-mts-callbtn href="tel:{{ settings.phone_href | default: settings.phone | remove: ' ' }}"
     aria-label="Call us on {{ settings.phone }}" tabindex="-1" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="callbtn__ic">{% render 'mts-icon', name: 'phone', size: 20 %}</span>
    {%- comment -%}
      The button itself is a bare circle now, so the label rides alongside it as
      a small fixed teaser rather than living inside the button — that keeps the
      target round while still saying what it does. aria-hidden because the
      anchor's own label already reads out the full number.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    <span class="callbtn__teaser" aria-hidden="true">Call us</span>
  </a>
{%- endif -%}
